WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.610
This is the singularity... one day at a time.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.150
Here's the last 24 hours in AI. Sorry... SI.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.270
AI learned teamwork.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:20.440
Four Google agents beat Minecraft together, with zero human help.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.380
27 hours, over 600 deaths, one dragon. They even shared notes.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.550
The bots: Anthropic is reportedly asking l

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.230
awyers how AI agents should haggle for us.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.980
Picture your AI bargaining with a seller's AI,

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.740
maybe with signed rules on what it can agree to.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.620
Google gave away a tool that lets agents rewrite their own playbook,

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.580
and get better without a new brain.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.740
And Anthropic invited law professors to ask: w

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.570
ho should get the final say on Claude's values?

