Money: Microsoft has pulled out of what would be Britain's biggest AI data centre,

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:05.860
the BBC says.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.750
And rivals team up: Samsung will reportedly us

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:14.080
e TSMC to help make Nvidia's next memory chips.

