A distributor says $470,000 of Nvidia grap

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.810
hics cards vanished at a Brazilian airport.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:27.110
And in Louisiana, locals are training for jobs at Meta's biggest data centre.

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:28.310
Why not get in now?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.840
The future: the World Bank says small AI on a pho

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.670
ne could turn centuries of progress into decades.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.690
Think soil advice for farmers in India,

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:42.270
in their own language, right on their phones.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.100
The catch: Anthropic's safety bill only kicks in when $1 billion,

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.000
